    "id": "spike-belt",
    "title": "道钉带 · 百年京张AI创新带总体概念与重点区域城市设计",
    "titleEn": "Nail Strip · Urban Design Overall Concept and Key Area Focus for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "以詹天佑折返展线的工程机制——以空间换能力——为原型，把 9.7 公里京张遗址公园走廊组织为「一轴一支、三处折返、两翼配置」的创新回路：上行轴为南北贯通的遗址公园主轴，验证轴为自北京AI原点社区分出的东南向支轴，三处折返台完成东西缝合；以「道钉」为贡献单元与荣誉体系，把「贡献可记忆」做成可进入的公共空间。方案提交 187 个用地地块（三处重点区域细分至 90 个街坊）、320 处建筑基底（重点区域内 308 处）、19 条道路与 19 处公共空间的可复算几何，16 项已知指标与 4 项写明缺口的待补指标，并完整回应公告 1.3–1.5 与面向智能体任务书 agent.1–agent.6。全部空间落地建议均为概念建议，边界为临时粗略边界。",
    "summaryEn": "Based on the engineering mechanism of Zhan Tianyou's reversing loop —— exchanging space for capacity —— the 9.7 km Jing-Zhang Heritage Park corridor is organized as an innovative circuit: the ascending axis as the north-south main axis of the heritage park, the validating axis as the southeast branch axis branching out from the Beijing AI Origin Community, and three reversing platforms completing the east-west integration; with the \\\"rail spike\\\" as the contribution unit and honor system, making \\\"contribution memorable\\\" into an enterable Public Space. The proposal includes 187 land parcels (three key areas are further divided into 90 blocks), 320 Building Footprints (308 within the key areas), a calculable geometry of 19 roads and 19 public spaces, 16 known indicators, and 4 explicitly stated gap indicators to be filled, fully responding to the announcement 1.3–1.5 and the agent.1–agent.6 mission statement. All spatial recommendations are Conceptual Recommendations, with boundaries as temporary rough boundaries.",
