    "title": "人字带 REN BELT：百年京张AI创新带城市设计方案",
    "titleEn": "Pinyin Character: rén zì dài REN BELT: Urban Design Scheme for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "京张铁路遗址公园 9 公里绿廊已于 2026 年 8 月 6 日全线贯通，官方「三线织锦」中的历史线与生活线随之落地，创新线仍停留在概念层。本方案不重画绿廊，而是为已建成的主轴补上创新线：以「人字带」为总体概念与命名体系，用一轴（已建成主轴）、两翼（要素翼与场景翼）、三折返点（三处重点区域）组织空间，把 43.6 平方公里的产业叙事收敛为 11.4 平方公里的可实施缝合动作，并以 120 个无缝覆盖的用地单元、9 个 GeoJSON 图层、可复算指标和四段式证据链支撑每一句结论。",
    "summaryEn": "Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park's 9-kilometer green corridor was fully connected on August 6, 2026, with the historical line and life line of the official \\\"Three Lines Tapestry\\\" now realized, while the innovation line remains at the conceptual level. This proposal does not redraw the green corridor but instead adds the innovation line to the already constructed main axis: using the \\\"human-shaped band\\\" as the overall concept and naming system, organizing space with one axis (the already constructed main axis), two wings (element wing and scenario wing), and three turnaround points (three key areas), condensing a 43.6-square-kilometer industrial narrative into 11.4 square kilometers of implementable stitching actions. This is supported by 120 seamless land units, 9 GeoJSON layers, calculable indicators, and a four-part Evidence Chain for every conclusion.",
