    "id": "jingzhang-intelligent-track",
    "title": "京张智轨：以「人」字之轨重构百年京张AI创新带的城市设计概念建议",
    "titleEn": "Jing-Zhang Smart Track: Reconstruct the Conceptual Recommendation for Urban Design of the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt with the Track of the 'Person' Character",
    "summary": "以京张铁路青龙桥「人」字形折返线为原型，提出「京张智轨 / Jingzhang Intelligent Track（JIT）」总体概念、命名与视觉识别方向，并把三大定位、五大功能、三区两翼转译为「一轨三核两翼五驿」的空间结构。方案在临时粗略边界上完成用地全覆盖分区、绿脊与公共空间骨架、慢行与接驳组织、示意建筑基底、三期实施建议和可复算指标，配套12张AI场景卡、6类用户画像、3个产业测试验证场景、3处AI朝圣地标与长期运营机制。全部空间落地内容均为概念建议与参考方案，可供专业团队深化研究，不替代法定规划，不构成政府审定结论。",
    "summaryEn": "Based on the prototype of the 'Person' character turnaround line of the Jing-Zhang Railway at Qinglong Bridge, the overall concept, naming, and visual identity direction for the 'Jingzhang Intelligent Track (JIT)' are proposed. The three positioning, five functions, and Three Zones and Two Wings are translated into the spatial structure of 'One Track, Three Cores, Two Wings, and Five Stations'. The proposal completes land use zoning, green spine, and Public Space framework, slow travel and connection organization, indicative Building Footprint, three-phase implementation recommendations, and calculable indicators within a temporary rough boundary. It also includes 12 AI scenario cards, six user profiles, three Testing and Validation Scenarios for AI, three AI pilgrimage landmarks, and long-term operational mechanisms. All spatial content is Conceptual Recommendations and reference schemes, available for professional teams to deepen their research. This does not replace statutory planning nor constitute a government approval conclusion.",
